			"notes": "# LRTactical 0.4.0 Update\n\nThis release updates the mod to **LRTactical 0.4.0**, introduces a complete third-person melee animation implementation for Minecraft 1.21.1, and resolves Issues #4–#7.\n\n## Updated\n\n* Added a third-person melee animation system powered by **Player Animator**.\n* Updated the project to match the latest state of the upstream branch.\n\n## Fixed\n\n* Fixed melee weapons not displaying or consuming durability due to missing damage data components.\n  Resolves #4.\n\n* Fixed `AnvilMenuMixin#onCreateResult` incorrectly cancelling anvil operations and clearing the output slot for non-`ICustomItem` items.\n  Resolves #5.\n\n* Fixed attribute modifiers defined in weapon JSON files not being applied to items.\n  Resolves #6.\n\n* Fixed melee weapon compatibility with **TaCZ Tweaks**.\n  Resolves #7."
		},
